12
00:00:16,733 --> 00:00:18,700
<i>It's a women's clothing
and lifestyle store.</i>

13
00:00:18,833 --> 00:00:20,767
<i>We can get out of here, too.
Just hide!</i>

14
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,267
<i>Go, Joey. Take care.
I'll cover you.</i>

15
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:24,267
<i> How about you?</i>

16
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,400
<i>I'll meet you at the boarding
house.</i>

17
00:00:25,533 --> 00:00:29,333
<i> One, two, three! You run!</i>

18
00:00:29,467 --> 00:00:30,000
