23
00:00:35,167 --> 00:00:37,433
<i> The one we encountered before.</i>

24
00:00:37,567 --> 00:00:40,100
<i>He must have had an idea about
our organization.</i>

25
00:00:40,233 --> 00:00:43,367
<i>You won't realize you're going
to confront him.</i>

26
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,667
<i> I know where to find Golda.</i>

27
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,567
<i>- At Amoroso.
- At Amoroso.</i>

28
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:48,667
<i> How did you know?</i>

29
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:51,433
<i>From the logo Golda was wearing
when we saw her.</i>

30
00:00:51,567 --> 00:00:53,033
<i> There's only one store, Joey.</i>

31
00:00:53,167 --> 00:00:54,067
<i> At Amoroso.</i>

32
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:56,433
<i> I really appreciate that</i>

33
00:00:56,567 --> 00:00:58,867
<i>even though I said some unkind
things to you,</i>

34
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,467
<i> you still wanted to help me.</i>

35
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:02,333
<i> So thank you, Andrew.</i>

36
00:01:02,467 --> 00:01:05,067
<i> I guess, we'll go to Amoroso.l</i>

37
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:29,833
Hey!

38
00:01:29,967 --> 00:01:33,633
Hi, Ma'am Golda. Welcome back!
Have a seat, Ma'am.

39
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,867
Oh my, you need to entertain me

40
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:42,667
because stress eating isn't
working for me anymore.

41
00:01:42,833 --> 00:01:46,933
Maybe I'll try stress dressing

42
00:01:47,067 --> 00:01:49,533
