right?

43
00:01:49,667 --> 00:01:50,900
Perfect, Ma'am.

44
00:01:51,033 --> 00:01:55,300
We have a new arrival,
for attention grabber!

45
00:01:55,433 --> 00:01:57,500
I want lthat!

46
