I want something sexy
and sophisticated!

47
00:02:01,633 --> 00:02:05,533
Something that makes the rich
and famous look at me and say...

48
00:02:05,667 --> 00:02:06,800
Who's that?

49
00:02:06,933 --> 00:02:08,733
I want her number.

50
00:02:08,867 --> 00:02:10,767
That's it! I want that!

51
00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:13,467
Ma'am, I know something
that's right for you.

52
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,867
