53
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,000
I want that! That's so cute!

54
00:02:22,133 --> 00:02:22,933
Let me try it.

55
00:02:23,067 --> 00:02:24,567
Okay.

56
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:26,967
So nice!

57
00:02:40,733 --> 00:02:42,233
<i> Is this Amoroso?</i>

58
00:02:42,367 --> 00:02:43,033
Yeah.

59
00:02:43,167 --> 00:02:45,267
