80
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,467
Yes, go!

81
00:03:55,267 --> 00:03:57,400
- Ma'am, here it is.
- Okay, thank you.

82
00:03:59,933 --> 00:04:01,400
Hello, Cous?

83
00:04:01,533 --> 00:04:04,100
<i>Well, it's a good thing you
callelld.</i>

84
