You're so dramatic, Matias.

117
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:57,233
Getting all worked up because
of a low-class drug runner.

118
00:05:57,367 --> 00:05:58,367
My god.

119
00:05:58,500 --> 00:05:59,733
I'm sorry,

120
00:06:00,833 --> 00:06:02,500
but I don't want to be
complacent,

121
00:06:03,933 --> 00:06:06,800
especially since someone
else is looking for Golda,

122
00:06:06,933 --> 00:06:08,333
right.

123
