125
00:06:13,067 --> 00:06:15,233
And why would Lisa
be dragged down?

126
00:06:17,033 --> 00:06:17,633
Golda?

127
00:06:17,767 --> 00:06:19,033
Golda? Why are you touching me?

128
00:06:19,167 --> 00:06:20,133
You know this is a dressing
room!

129
00:06:20,267 --> 00:06:21,800
