136
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:35,167
Well, it's not Golda here.

137
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:36,900
Look for her downstairs
right away.

138
00:06:37,033 --> 00:06:39,667
We're going downstairs too.
I'll just fix the mess here.

139
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,767
Okay, okay, okay, I'll go.

140
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:45,133
