144
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:51,567
- It's a nuisance!
- Come on, come on.

145
00:06:51,700 --> 00:06:54,633
- Don't touch me!
- Sorry. Sorry.

146
00:06:54,767 --> 00:06:56,967
Excuse me. Come on, come on.

147
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:59,200
What's wrong, Miss?
Scold them, Miss!

148
00:06:59,333 --> 00:07:02,833
Ma'am, I'm sorry I'll just
give you a discount, Ma'am.

149
00:07:20,633 --> 00:07:21,667
What's with you?

150
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,033
Can't you wait?

151
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:30,533
- Hello, Peter?
- Joey, Joey, Golda's leaving.

152
00:07:30,667 --> 00:07:31,833
Come here now!

153
00:07:31,967 --> 00:07:32,833
Now!

154
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,400
Boss, wait, wait!

155
00:07:39,533 --> 00:07:41,400
Wait, my shoelace!

156
00:07:43,133 --> 00:07:44,533
Wait?

157
00:07:44,667 --> 00:07:45,633
Hey, step aside.

158
00:07:45,767 --> 00:07:48,167
Joey, hurry up!

159
00:07:48,333 --> 00:07:49,733
What's that?

160
00:07:49,867 --> 00:07:51,433
There's a crazy guy blocking
the way, Ma'am!

161
00:07:51,567 --> 00:07:53,333
Then avoid him!

162
00:08:13,467 --> 00:08:15,300
Peter!

163
00:08:15,433 --> 00:08:16,867
Let's go, let's go, let's go.

164
00:08:21,733 --> 00:08:22,667
It's...

165
