173
00:08:50,833 --> 00:08:52,767
Are we rusty?

174
00:08:52,900 --> 00:08:55,500
Is it because of the compromised
shipments?

175
00:08:55,667 --> 00:08:59,500
We also had some deals canceled
because the client backed out.

176
00:08:59,633 --> 00:09:01,433
Matias,

177
00:09:01,567 --> 00:09:04,167
when was the last time you spoke
to Braganza?

178
00:09:04,300 --> 00:09:09,333
It's been a while since he
formed his own group in VisMin.

179
00:09:09,467 --> 00:09:10,967
Well, guess what?

180
00:09:12,233 --> 00:09:15,000
He's not just working in VisMin.

181
00:09:15,133 --> 00:09:20,233
