are now his.

183
00:09:27,133 --> 00:09:30,833
And I'm sure, he'll follow
the NCR too!

184
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,567
Sir.

185
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,200
Golda.

186
00:10:18,733 --> 00:10:19,800
Godfather!

187
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,300
Wow...

188
00:10:30,633 --> 00:10:33,033
Your guns are driving me crazy,
Godfather.

189
00:10:33,167 --> 00:10:34,700
It's like a coup d'etat.

190
00:10:36,100 --> 00:10:38,200
That's how it should be, hija.

191
00:10:38,333 --> 00:10:41,133
Every day is revolution day.

192
00:10:41,267 --> 00:10:44,900
The only question is,
which side are you on?

193
00:10:45,033 --> 00:10:50,300
Me, I grind between the legal
and the illegal.

194
00:10:50,433 --> 00:10:53,800
That way, when the war
continues,

195
00:10:53,933 --> 00:10:55,867
I'm still the supplier.

196
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,500
I'm still the winner.

197
00:10:59,433 --> 00:11:01,967
You're really brainy, Godfather.

198
00:11:02,100 --> 00:11:05,800
You're full of foolishness.
You know,

199
00:11:05,933 --> 00:11:09,867
I did some digging on your man,
Braganza.

200
00:11:10,033 --> 00:11:12,567
He seems okay.

201
00:11:12,700 --> 00:11:14,567
Come on, Godfather!

202
00:11:14,700 --> 00:11:19,900
Of course, I won't introduce you
to any sloppy clients.

203
00:11:20,033 --> 00:11:24,400
You only deserve the best
of the bestest.

204
00:11:24,533 --> 00:11:26,333
That's what I want from you.

205
00:11:26,467 --> 00:11:28,833
You're a great flatterer.

206
00:11:28,967 --> 00:11:30,033
I know, right?

207
00:11:30,167 --> 00:11:32,800
That's why I convinced you
to let me stay here

208
00:11:32,933 --> 00:11:34,933
in your fancy villa.

209
00:11:36,333 --> 00:11:37,900
That's nothing.

210
00:11:38,033 --> 00:11:42,200
I have to protect the people
that can affect my business.

211
00:11:43,867 --> 00:11:46,100
Didn't you say someone
was looking for you?

212
00:11:47,867 --> 00:11:49,333
<i> How did you find me?</i>

213
00:11:49,467 --> 00:11:50,600
<i> I'm Miguel Delgado's son.</i>

214
00:11:50,733 --> 00:11:52,067
<i> Don't follow me, okay?</i>

215
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:54,033
<i>They won't be able
to get near me</i>

216
00:11:54,167 --> 00:11:56,700
<i>because I'm about to become
untouchable.</i>

217
00:11:56,833 --> 00:11:59,800
You look worried.
I don't like that.

218
00:11:59,933 --> 00:12:01,467
