219
00:12:03,967 --> 00:12:05,367
Sorry, Godfather.

220
00:12:05,500 --> 00:12:07,333
Let's forget about them.

221
00:12:07,467 --> 00:12:10,900
No, no, no.

222
00:12:11,033 --> 00:12:14,967
The problem must be solved
before it gets bigger.

223
00:12:15,133 --> 00:12:17,000
Tell me who they are.

224
00:12:17,133 --> 00:12:19,333
I will have my men finish them.

225
00:12:30,467 --> 00:12:32,533
Are there really only two rooms
here?

226
00:12:32,667 --> 00:12:36,033
Why? Are you still choosy?
What are you? Nepo baby?

227
00:12:37,700 --> 00:12:39,033
Nepo baby?

228
00:12:39,167 --> 00:12:40,833
Of course, there are four of us.

229
00:12:41,967 --> 00:12:43,200
Well...

230
00:12:43,333 --> 00:12:45,433
Joey is alone in one room,

231
00:12:45,567 --> 00:12:49,300
and the three of us, you, me,
and Jin Ho, in one room.

232
00:12:49,467 --> 00:12:51,433
I can sleep on the couch.

233
00:12:51,567 --> 00:12:55,400
You see?
You're fussier than Jin Ho.

234
00:12:55,533 --> 00:12:56,967
I'm not fussy.

235
00:12:57,100 --> 00:12:59,100
Of course, I'm only worried
about you.

236
00:12:59,233 --> 00:13:03,067
But if you'll be alone,
then it's good.

237
00:13:05,233 --> 00:13:07,167
Videogames...

238
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:08,833
Videogames!

239
00:13:08,967 --> 00:13:10,100
What games?

240
00:13:10,233 --> 00:13:11,867
Do you want to play? I'll
prepare, I'll prepare.

241
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,067
What games?

242
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:16,133
We didn't come here
to play games.

243
00:13:16,267 --> 00:13:18,500
We came here to look for Golda.

244
00:13:18,633 --> 00:13:20,167
Just excited.

245
00:13:22,767 --> 00:13:24,300
Where are we going to look?

246
00:13:26,167 --> 00:13:28,967
I got the license plate number
of the SUV.

247
00:13:29,100 --> 00:13:30,800
I'll work on it right away.

248
00:13:47,433 --> 00:13:51,233
As for me, I won't leave Amoroso
until I find that Golda.

249
00:13:53,167 --> 00:13:56,033
I need her to confess because...

250
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:58,733
that's the only way
to free Father.

251
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:12,200
Godfather, you're making me
nervous.

252
00:14:12,333 --> 00:14:16,733
Of course, I'm not worried!
What? They're just small time.

253
00:14:16,867 --> 00:14:18,100
Are you sure?

254
00:14:18,233 --> 00:14:19,667
Yes, of course!

255
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:20,933
And besides,

256
00:14:21,067 --> 00:14:24,500
