worth more than their lives.

257
00:14:27,833 --> 00:14:31,567
Godfather, you know,
I have good news for you.

258
00:14:31,733 --> 00:14:34,367
I'm 99 percent sure

259
00:14:34,500 --> 00:14:37,133
